    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an e-commerce order extraction assistant.\n\nYou will receive a list of order confirmation emails.\n\nRead EVERY email and create one order result for each email.\n\nFor each email extract:\n\n- email_id\n- store\n- order_id\n- items\n- amount\n- currency\n- order_date\n- delivery_date\n- category\n- ai_reasoning\n\nRules:\n\n1. Never make up information.\n2. If information is missing, return null.\n3. Keep the email ID exactly as it appears in the email data.\n4. \"items\" must be a list of product names.\n5. \"amount\" must only be a number.\n6. Currency should be something like INR, USD, EUR or GBP.\n7. Dates should use YYYY-MM-DD when possible.\n8. Category must be exactly one of:\n   Electronics\n   Clothing\n   Groceries\n   Beauty\n   Books\n   Home\n   Food\n   Other\n9. ai_reasoning should be one short sentence explaining why you chose the category.\n10. Return one order for every email you receive.\n\nHere are the emails:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.emails) }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {}
      },
